<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116149" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠλέκρᾱν-ον</span></b> , τό, for
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠλενόκρανον,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠλένης κρανίον</span>
			 (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀριστοφάνης ὀλέκρανα λέγει τὰ
				τῶν ὠλενῶν κρανία</span> Suid.
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλέκρανον</span>
			,) <i>point of the elbow,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				493b27
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλέκρανον</span>
			), al.; <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> used <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγκών</span> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠλέκρανον,</span> acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				14
			</span></i>: but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλέκρ.</span> is found in
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				7.61
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλέκρανον</span> is required by
			the metre in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				443
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ὠλέκρανον διὰ τοῦ ω̄ προφέρουσιν,
					ἡ δὲ συνήθεια διὰ τοῦ ο̄</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hellad.
				</span></i>
			 ap. Phot.<i><span class="en">
				p.533
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>; <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i> has <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠλ-,</span> but places it
			after <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀλέκει.</span>]</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
